{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivor of the Lost World is a survival barrage game similar to Rogue. In the lost doomsday world, deal with thousands of enemies, challenge strong enemies step by step through learning skills, improving abilities, and obtaining props, and ultimately achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trial version features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">01. All skills are automatically released, and you need to avoid attacks from groups of enemies and strive to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/extras/monsters.gif?t=1746191410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">02. Fast pace (20 minutes per game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/extras/levelup.gif?t=1746191410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">03. This demo version has sixteen skills for you to choose from, each of which can be upgraded to enhance your abilities. We believe you can build a satisfactory playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/extras/collection.gif?t=1746191410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">04. Pick up experience to upgrade, and each upgrade will randomly result in multiple ability improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697920?t=1746191410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/d0ae1822caa319d310049fe9dc636fe8c4b25ccc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746191410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/3e09e80530680297f787da9b6bae1c53c07f881c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746191410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/3e09e80530680297f787da9b6bae1c53c07f881c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746191410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivor of the Lost World is a survival barrage game similar to Rogue. In the lost doomsday world, deal with thousands of enemies, challenge strong enemies step by step through learning skills, improving abilities, and obtaining props, and ultimately achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trial version features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">01. All skills are automatically released, and you need to avoid attacks from groups of enemies and strive to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/extras/monsters.gif?t=1746191410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">02. Fast pace (20 minutes per game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/extras/levelup.gif?t=1746191410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">03. This demo version has sixteen skills for you to choose from, each of which can be upgraded to enhance your abilities. We believe you can build a satisfactory playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697920/extras/collection.gif?t=1746191410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">04. Pick up experience to upgrade, and each upgrade will randomly result in multiple ability improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Li Yangde"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3696180","name":"Lost World Survivor"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app